<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-DEWULF LOSES THIRD SET 6-1.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DEWULF LOSES THIRD SET 6-1.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Filip Dewulf lost the third set 6-1 in his semifinal match against Brazilian Gustavo Kuerten at the French Open on Friday.</p>
<p>Kuerten won the first set 6-1, Dewulf the second 6-3.</p>
</text>
